{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who am I? To find the answer, talk to people, learn words, and unlock new conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Am I: Error Code 99</strong> is an action novel game where you save memories and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To know yourself, talk to others.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the icons displayed on the map to converse with people.<br>Someone out there might know who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/91f31f18ba583fe46f10c642226e2d96.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn words and discover new conversations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save words that appear in conversations and try talking to other people.<br>You might receive a different answer this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.poster.avif?t=1759157985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.webm?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/extras/4974b562bb8bd55a46fcd3e02c1125c2.mp4?t=1759157985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can remember up to three words.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the necessary words carefully.<br>Because of your injuries, you can't remember too many words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's beyond the conversations...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is distorted.<br>To regain your memories, you might face great suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for that?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u30cb\u56de\u76ee\u306e\u6b7b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423270/6396c7044a83ef6c28ab9e57602f558ad2f1ae55.jpg"},{"name":"\u304b\u304d\u6d88\u3055\u308c\u305f\u7523\u58f0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423270/8a8c4255d2480517cf2307dc1922af6de569bf02.jpg"},{"name":"0.01\uff05\u306e\u5e0c\u671b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423270/da3f27d9d824976c3ea23008ef63549f35ced658.jpg"},{"name":"\u3042\u308a\u3075\u308c\u305f\u602a\u7570","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423270/f0c7b51541f51e50d4df2e0ce66a3296c65b57f5.jpg"},{"name":"\u30a8\u30e9\u30fc\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u4e5d\u5341\u4e5d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3423270/556962c4c900c1e02e436bd1295e01603b4195b2.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423270?t=1759157985","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423270?t=1759157985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423270/e481e3f9bc2cf661d1f4d21b5995fcba04caef42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759157985","capsule_imag